            {
              "id": "abd1dfc2-16a3-37c0-97b7-13ba6df726d0",
              "name": "JWT Token Vulnerability Detected",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe vulnerability in question is related to the insecure storage of JSON Web Tokens (JWT) in the local storage of a web browser. JWTs are often used to store user session information and can contain sensitive data. Storing them in local storage can expose them to Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) attacks, where an attacker can inject malicious scripts into a web page to steal these tokens.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, it is recommended to store JWTs in HTTP-only cookies. This makes them inaccessible to JavaScript and thus safe from XSS attacks. Additionally, it is also recommended to set the Secure flag for cookies to ensure they are only sent over HTTPS connections.\n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nInstead of using `localStorage.setItem()`, use `httpOnly` cookies to store the JWT. Here is an example of how to set an `httpOnly` cookie in Express.js:\n\n```javascript\nconst express = require('express');\nconst cookieParser = require('cookie-parser');\n\nconst app = express();\napp.use(cookieParser());\n\napp.get('/login', (req, res) => {\n  // ... authentication logic ...\n\n  // Set JWT as an HTTP-only and Secure cookie\n  res.cookie('token', 'your.jwt.here', { httpOnly: true, secure: true });\n});\n```\n\n## Library Dependencies\n\nThe code example requires the following libraries:\n\n- `express`: A web application framework for Node.js.\n- `cookie-parser`: Middleware for parsing cookies in Express.js.\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP JWT Cheat Sheet](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/JSON_Web_Token_for_Java_Cheat_Sheet.html)\n- [CWE-352: Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF)](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/352.html)\n- [CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html)"
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [
                  {
                    "id": "CWE-352",
                    "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/352.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "CWE-79",
                    "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html"
                  }
                ],
                "severity": "MEDIUM",
                "kind": "FAIL",
                "tags": [
                  "CWE-352",
                  "CWE-79"
                ]
              }
